          "kind": "reported_message",
          "speakerId": "bright",
          "text": "先递给门前接待的人引荐即可。馆主若是愿意见，自然会出来同你说话；若是有急诊在忙，也得看他们里头的安排。"
        },
        "certainty": "uncertain",
        "visibility": "private"
      },
      "dialogue.693501ae07d964cf566e2ca37027f15acfe49ad5e9d579840f9d2e4d88f7bd87.1afa695f2be487dcae13a093af74ec27b4e25bf368edc6f58e44b9f4fe0d35ec.message": {
        "id": "dialogue.693501ae07d964cf566e2ca37027f15acfe49ad5e9d579840f9d2e4d88f7bd87.1afa695f2be487dcae13a093af74ec27b4e25bf368edc6f58e44b9f4fe0d35ec.message",
        "entityId": "huang",
        "field": "reported_message",
        "value": {
          "kind": "reported_message",
          "speakerId": "huang",
          "text": "靠里面的那家，匾额上写着九雪。"
        },
        "effectiveAt": {
          "id": "legacy.story.order",
          "clock": "turn",
          "at": 18,
          "actorId": "legacy.story"
        },
        "certainty": "uncertain",
        "visibility": "private",
        "discoveryConditions": [
          "actual-receipt"
        ],
        "dependencyRefs": []
      },
      "dialogue.693501ae07d964cf566e2ca37027f15acfe49ad5e9d579840f9d2e4d88f7bd87.273a31f4bc1eba624df5b13384fff1dd3ec657ddc52b69a16a372f055d7fdd31.message": {
        "id": "dialogue.693501ae07d964cf566e2ca37027f15acfe49ad5e9d579840f9d2e4d88f7bd87.273a31f4bc1eba624df5b13384fff1dd3ec657ddc52b69a16a372f055d7fdd31.message",
        "entityId": "huang",
        "field": "reported_message",
        "value": {
          "kind": "reported_message",
          "speakerId": "huang",
          "text": "不过门板是合上的，外面没挂接诊的牌子，门前也没见有人进出。"
        },
        "effectiveAt": {
          "id": "legacy.story.order",
          "clock": "turn",
          "at": 18,
          "actorId": "legacy.story"
        },
        "certainty": "uncertain",
        "visibility": "private",
        "discoveryConditions": [
          "actual-receipt"
        ],
        "dependencyRefs": []
      }
    },
    "events": {
      "received.dialogue.693501ae07d964cf566e2ca37027f15acfe49ad5e9d579840f9d2e4d88f7bd87.1afa695f2be487dcae13a093af74ec27b4e25bf368edc6f58e44b9f4fe0d35ec": {
        "id": "received.dialogue.693501ae07d964cf566e2ca37027f15acfe49ad5e9d579840f9d2e4d88f7bd87.1afa695f2be487dcae13a093af74ec27b4e25bf368edc6f58e44b9f4fe0d35ec",
        "kind": "message.arrived",
        "data": {
          "knowerIds": [
            "player",
            "bright"
          ],
          "propositionRefs": [
            "dialogue.693501ae07d964cf566e2ca37027f15acfe49ad5e9d579840f9d2e4d88f7bd87.1afa695f2be487dcae13a093af74ec27b4e25bf368edc6f58e44b9f4fe0d35ec.message"
          ],
          "at": {
            "id": "legacy.story.order",
            "clock": "turn",
            "at": 18,
            "actorId": "legacy.story"
          },
          "sourceAnchor": {
            "chatId": "901 帝都正式续玩 20261106",
            "messageId": 18,
            "swipeId": 0,
            "text": "黄泉牵着马停在桥头，视线越过矮石栏，顺着桥对面的整排门面逐一看过去。\n\n那几间挂着木匾的铺子隔着些距离，门前大多挂着挑出屋檐的幌子。最前头几家正开门营业，抓药与问询的顾客进进出出。\n\n黄泉看清了中间偏深处的一处门脸，抬手指了指：\n\n“靠里面的那家，匾额上写着九雪。”\n\n她顺着那方向打量了片刻，眉头略微动了动，补充了一句：\n\n“不过门板是合上的，外面没挂接诊的牌子，门前也没见有人进出。”\n\n布莱特牵着马立在御临风身旁，听到黄泉的话，侧耳朝桥对面的街巷辨了辨，只能听到邻近几家药铺的捣药声与算盘声，九雪医馆那头确实显得格外安静。\n\n<StatusPlaceHolderImpl/>"
          }
        },
        "sourceRefs": [
